@attribute [Authorize(Roles = "CollegeAdmin")]

@* A CollegeAdmin authors the national catalogue (T091): the College's specialities, its EPAs and its curricula. Until T261
   Home had no case for the role, so a CollegeAdmin saw the trainee's dashboard: "No curriculum assigned yet", and links
   to pages that refuse a CollegeAdmin. It reads nothing, so it has no query and no StatePanel. Its links are the
   CollegeAdmin's nav row (DESIGN.md § The NavMenu). *@
<div class="dashboard-grid">
  <DashboardCard Title="National catalogue" Icon="book" Emphasis="true" Span="2">
    <p class="muted">Your college's specialities, its EPAs and its curricula. Institutions adopt an active curriculum to train against it.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--space-sm);flex-wrap:wrap">
      <a href="/admin/specialities" class="btn btn-outline">Specialities</a>
      <a href="/admin/epas" class="btn btn-outline">EPAs</a>
      <a href="/admin/curricula" class="btn btn-outline">Curricula</a>
    </div>
  </DashboardCard>
</div>
